    "heroTitle": "PUERTO RICO CORPORATE EVENTS",
    "lines": [
      "PUERTO RICO",
      "CORPORATE EVENTS",
      "Amber Walker Events is renowned for expertly planning events for large brands and companies that goes beyond just design + planning. Our team works hands on with our clients to understand business goals, logistics and marketing needs to ensure the event is not only delivered well by guests, but also goals are met. This full service approach beyond just planning has landed us some of the most respect global brands and clients.",
      "We are a full service event planning firm working with best of the best in the industry to bring ease to our clients projects and events. With Amber Walker Events, we have the skills and capabilities to plan and take care of all logistics including: marketing, agenda planning, print materials, staffing, attendee management and much more!",
      "Amber Walker Events has offices in both Toronto and Los Angeles with satellite offices in Chicago, New York, Miami, and Las Vegas; but we bring life to events all over the world.",
      "AS SEEN ON",
      "WHAT WE PLAN",
      "THOUGHTFUL PLANNING. IMPECCABLE EXECUTION. UNFORGETTABLE EXPERIENCES.",
      "A5165EEE-2AB7-4675-91CD-21B518940F5C",
      "LET’S CREATE SOMETHING UNFORGETTABLE",
      "SCHEDULE NOW",
      "YOUR IN GOOD COMPANY",
      "TRUSTED BY CLIENTS ACROSS EVERY TYPE OF CELEBRATION",
      "CLICK HERE FOR PHOTO GALLERY",
      "CLICK HERE FOR VIDEO GALLERY",
      "Let’s Start Planning",
      "SCHEDULE A CALL WITH AMBER TO CHAT ABOUT YOUR EVENT",
      "Corporate Event",
      "Social Event",
      "Wedding Planning",
      "Proposal Planning"
    ],
