    "heroTitle": "NEW YORK PROPOSAL PLANNING",
    "lines": [
      "NEW YORK PROPOSAL PLANNING",
      "Thinking of popping the question? Let me arrange the details while you just focus on what to say to that special someone!",
      "Proposals can be as iconic and unforgettable as the city itself. Picture a private rooftop engagement with skyline views, a surprise flash mob in Times Square, a Central Park carriage ride leading to a heartfelt proposal, or an intimate dinner in a Michelin-starred restaurant. Whether you envision a classic, timeless moment or an extravagant, show-stopping surprise, the possibilities are endless. The following ideas serve as inspiration—your proposal will be tailored to your unique love story. First step? Get in touch! There’s no obligation, and we’ll connect at your convenience to bring your vision to life.",
      "AS SEEN ON",
      "PROPOSAL PLANNING  PACKAGE",
      "Three unique proposal ideas customized to your needs for you to choose from complete with vision, design, venue, and breakdown of cost",
      "​",
      "30 minute consultation via phone",
      "​",
      "One of out personal planners works closely with you to design a custom proposal from your vision and budget",
      "​",
      "Photo examples and sketch of the overall event vision",
      "​",
      "Privately curated list of suitable venues and vendors",
      "​",
      "Personal concierge executing all bookings",
      "Step-by-step itinerary of day-of timeline",
      "​",
      "Foolproof strategies to maintain full surprise until arrival",
      "​",
      "Full setup and takedown. Planner personally executes full proposal set up and is available on-site throughout the entire event",
      "CONTACT US FOR A FREE CONSULTATION",
      "YOUR IN GOOD COMPANY",
      "TRUSTED BY CLIENTS ACROSS EVERY TYPE OF CELEBRATION",
      "CLICK HERE FOR PHOTO GALLERY",
      "CLICK HERE FOR VIDEO GALLERY",
      "Let’s Start Planning",
      "SCHEDULE A CALL WITH AMBER TO CHAT ABOUT YOUR PROPOSAL",
      "Corporate Event",
      "Social Event",
      "Wedding Planning",
      "Proposal Planning"
    ],
