    "heroTitle": "WEDDING PLANNING PALM SPRINGS",
    "lines": [
      "WEDDING PLANNING PALM SPRINGS",
      "Planning your wedding? Let me take care of the details so you can focus on what truly matters.",
      "​",
      "Imagine stepping into a celebration where every detail feels effortlessly designed for you. Breathtaking floral displays that transform the space, candlelight casting a warm golden glow, music rising at just the right moment, and an atmosphere that feels both magical and timeless. Whether you envision an opulent ballroom filled with elegance, a romantic ceremony beneath the stars, or an intimate gathering at a private estate, your wedding will be more than an event, it will be an unforgettable experience that leaves your guests in awe. Every element is orchestrated with care, precision, and artistry to ensure the day unfolds seamlessly while reflecting the true essence of your story.",
      "​",
      "The first step is simple: get in touch, and together we’ll begin shaping a day you and your loved ones will remember forever.",
      "WHERE LOVE MEETS LUXURY",
      "For over a decade, Amber Walker Events has been the premier choice for couples seeking extraordinary experiences. Known for transforming visions into reality, we bring a level of elegance, creativity, and seamless execution that sets us apart. Every celebration is designed to reflect your unique love story, ensuring your wedding is as unforgettable as the commitment you’re making. Our expertise in weddings includes:",
      "​",
      "Engagement Proposals – Renowned for orchestrating hundreds of unforgettable proposals, each crafted to be as unique as the couple’s journey.",
      "​",
      "Luxury Weddings – From grand, opulent celebrations to refined, intimate gatherings, we design weddings that blend breathtaking beauty with flawless logistics.",
      "​",
      "Ceremonies & Receptions – Every moment, from walking down the aisle to the last dance, is thoughtfully curated to flow seamlessly and leave lasting impressions.",
      "​",
      "Pre-Wedding Events – Engagement parties, bridal showers, rehearsal dinners, and more — each infused with style and attention to detail.",
      "​",
      "Destination Weddings – Bringing your dream celebration to life anywhere in the world with precision, creativity, and care.",
      "​",
      "At Amber Walker Events, no two weddings are ever the same. We don’t just plan — we create timeless, one-of-a-kind experiences that will be remembered for a lifetime.",
      "CALL US NOW",
      "AS SEEN ON",
      "YOUR IN GOOD COMPANY",
      "TRUSTED BY CLIENTS ACROSS EVERY TYPE OF CELEBRATION",
      "Let’s Start Planning",
      "SCHEDULE A CALL WITH AMBER TO CHAT ABOUT YOUR EVENT",
      "Corporate Event",
      "Social Event",
      "Wedding Planning",
      "Proposal Planning"
    ],
